Subject: [PATCH] gyp: add link_settings to base_non_configuration_keys

GYP's SetUpConfigurations() iterates over the target dict and copies
any key not listed in base_non_configuration_keys into every
configuration dict. link_settings is missing from the list, so when
a target has a top-level link_settings (e.g. v8.gyp's
v8_base_without_compiler conditionally adds '-latomic' for arm),
it gets propagated into Debug/Release configurations and then
invalid_configuration_keys validation rejects it.

Upstream-Status: Pending [also missing in nodejs/gyp-next master]

--- a/tools/gyp/pylib/gyp/input.py
+++ b/tools/gyp/pylib/gyp/input.py
@@ -91,6 +91,7 @@
     "dependencies",
     "dependencies_original",
     "libraries",
+    "link_settings",
     "postbuilds",
     "product_dir",
     "product_extension",
